{"chunkId": "f774afea-899d-5623-9839-3a0832ad7a3c", "text": "关键词助记：将需要记忆的新词汇与一个熟悉的关键词联想，通过形成心理意象来辅助记忆词汇含义。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-keyword-mnemonic", "strategyName": "关键词助记", "chunkType": "definition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}}}
{"chunkId": "76c40c32-39f6-59ca-8e55-63db8ef0d30d", "text": "关键词助记的第 1 步：选择与目标词汇发音相近的熟悉关键词。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-keyword-mnemonic", "strategyName": "关键词助记", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 1, "totalSteps": 4}}
{"chunkId": "e75c5981-b6c5-547d-941d-649ed88fdc03", "text": "关键词助记的第 2 步：建立关键词与目标词汇之间的语音联想。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-keyword-mnemonic", "strategyName": "关键词助记", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 2, "totalSteps": 4}}
{"chunkId": "ab2bee5b-a424-54b9-a29d-6294d0976e49", "text": "关键词助记的第 3 步：在脑海中形成关键词与词汇含义互动的心理图像。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-keyword-mnemonic", "strategyName": "关键词助记", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 3, "totalSteps": 4}}
{"chunkId": "28f41e05-c9ab-5b3f-b91d-050cd9db49ba", "text": "关键词助记的第 4 步：通过回忆心理图像来提取词汇含义。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-keyword-mnemonic", "strategyName": "关键词助记", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 4, "totalSteps": 4}}
{"chunkId": "c8c533fa-8639-5dd5-8bc4-0166de6a40d5", "text": "关键词助记适合外语词汇记忆，原因是：关键词助记在外语词汇学习中表现出即时和延时的记忆优势。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-keyword-mnemonic", "strategyName": "关键词助记", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "外语词汇记忆"}}
{"chunkId": "4ea5ad0c-7130-54e5-9399-19c7a83f0de6", "text": "关键词助记适合需要记忆配对信息（如术语定义），原因是：对于简单的配对学习任务，关键词法能有效促进记忆保持。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-keyword-mnemonic", "strategyName": "关键词助记", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "需要记忆配对信息（如术语定义）"}}
{"chunkId": "84c321a9-3e58-546a-ae0e-1a7a514dd54f", "text": "关键词助记不适合需要理解性学习的复杂材料，原因是：关键词法仅促进表面记忆，无法促进对材料深层含义的理解。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-keyword-mnemonic", "strategyName": "关键词助记", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "需要理解性学习的复杂材料"}}
{"chunkId": "c16e9a91-a331-5c84-a910-04e13fc0bfae", "text": "关键词助记不适合需要学习者自行生成关键词的材料，原因是：当学习者需要自己生成关键词时，效果可能消失甚至不如直接学习。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-keyword-mnemonic", "strategyName": "关键词助记", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "需要学习者自行生成关键词的材料"}}
